sequenceDiagram
    participant MM as ModelMesh Controller
    participant Puller as model-serving-puller<br/>8084/TCP gRPC
    participant Storage as Cloud Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Adapter as Runtime Adapter<br/>8085/TCP gRPC
    participant Runtime as Target Runtime<br/>8001/TCP (or 7071)
    participant FS as Local Filesystem<br/>/models

    Note over MM,Runtime: Flow 1: Model Loading

    MM->>Puller: LoadModel(modelId, modelKey)<br/>gRPC plaintext
    Puller->>Puller: Parse ModelKey JSON<br/>(storage type, path, credentials)

    alt S3 Storage
        Puller->>Storage: Download artifacts<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Access Key + Secret Key
    else GCS Storage
        Puller->>Storage: Download artifacts<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Service Account (private key)
    else Azure Blob
        Puller->>Storage: Download artifacts<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Connection String / SPN
    else HTTP Source
        Puller->>Storage: Download artifacts<br/>HTTP/HTTPS<br/>Auth: Optional mTLS + headers
    end

    Storage-->>Puller: Model artifacts
    Puller->>FS: Write to /models/{modelId}

    Puller->>Adapter: LoadModel(modelId, modelPath)<br/>gRPC plaintext loopback

    alt Triton Adapter
        Adapter->>FS: Create directory layout<br/>Generate config.pbtxt
        Adapter->>Runtime: RepositoryModelLoad(modelName)<br/>gRPC 8001/TCP
    else MLServer Adapter
        Adapter->>FS: Create directory layout<br/>Write model-settings.json
        Adapter->>Runtime: RepositoryModelLoad(modelName)<br/>gRPC 8001/TCP
    else OVMS Adapter
        Adapter->>FS: Create directory layout<br/>Update model_config_list.json
        Adapter->>Runtime: POST /v1/config/reload<br/>HTTP 8001/TCP
        loop Poll config status
            Adapter->>Runtime: GET /v1/config<br/>HTTP 8001/TCP
            Runtime-->>Adapter: Model state
        end
    else TorchServe Adapter
        Adapter->>FS: Symlink MAR to model store
        Adapter->>Runtime: RegisterModel(modelName)<br/>gRPC 7071/TCP
    end

    Runtime-->>Adapter: Load success
    Adapter-->>Puller: LoadModel response
    Puller-->>MM: LoadModel response (size info)

    Note over MM,Runtime: Flow 2: Model Unloading

    MM->>Puller: UnloadModel(modelId)<br/>gRPC plaintext
    Puller->>Adapter: UnloadModel(modelId)<br/>gRPC plaintext loopback

    alt Triton/MLServer
        Adapter->>Runtime: RepositoryModelUnload(modelName)<br/>gRPC 8001/TCP
    else OVMS
        Adapter->>FS: Update model_config_list.json<br/>(remove model entry)
        Adapter->>Runtime: POST /v1/config/reload<br/>HTTP 8001/TCP
    else TorchServe
        Adapter->>Runtime: UnregisterModel(modelName)<br/>gRPC 7071/TCP
    end

    Runtime-->>Adapter: Unload success
    Adapter->>FS: Cleanup model directory
    Adapter-->>Puller: UnloadModel response
    Puller->>FS: Remove /models/{modelId}
    Puller-->>MM: UnloadModel response

    Note over MM,Runtime: Flow 3: Keras Conversion (Triton only)

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Adapter->>Adapter: Detect Keras H5 model
        Adapter->>FS: exec tf_pb.py (Python subprocess)<br/>Max 2 concurrent conversions
        FS-->>Adapter: TF SavedModel output
    end
